"1 days left","allowed_organisations":[],"organisations":[],"attachment":[],"remainingDaysArray":{"durations":"1","text":"day left"},"isRegistrationFull":false},"isUserAdmin":false,"organisation":{"id":13183,"name":"Indian Institute of Technology, Indian School of Mines (IIT ISM), Dhanbad","description":"<ul>\n<li>The Indian Institute Of Technology (IIT) (ISM) Dhanbad was formally opened on 9th December 1926, by Lord Irwin, the then Viceroy of India, with disciplines of Mining and Applied Geology to address the necessity for trained manpower related to mining activities in the country.<\/li>\n<li>In 1967, it was given the status of a deemed-to-be-university under Section 3 of UGC Act, 1956.<\/li>\n<li>It is situated in the heart of the country&rsquo;s prime coking coal belt and is 260 km from Kolkata.<\/li>\n<li>Its campus is spread over an area of 393 acres.<\/li>\n<li>IIT (ISM) Dhanbad started as an institution to impart mining education. But later, it got converted into a full-fledged technical institution of international acclaim offering various programs like B.Tech., M.Tech., M.Sc. Tech., and MBA.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","public_url":"c\/indian-institute-of-technology-indian-school-of-mines-iit-ism-dhanbad-placement-interview-competitions-articles-videos-13183","logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/images\/partners\/partners75\/5d1994516e46b_IIT_dh_logo.png","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/images\/partners\/partners125\/5d1994516e46b_IIT_dh_logo.png","organisation_type":"3","wp_tag":672,"seo_url":"https:\/\/unstop.com\/c\/indian-institute-of-technology-indian-school-of-mines-iit-ism-dhanbad-placement-interview-competitions-articles-videos-13183","website":"https:\/\/www.iitism.ac.in\/","extra_fields":"{\"industry\":\"\",\"founder\":\"\",\"foundedOn\":\"\",\"keyPeople\":\"\",\"headquarter\":\"\",\"founderUrl\":\"\"}"},"rounds":[],"linked_submission":0,"submissionRound":null,"viewsCount":2939}}}